'''Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] and is on the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]] Version of [[The Battle Cats]]. He originates from Manya Immortal Nosuke's "Manga! The Battle Cats" and was created as promotional material for the CoroCoro Magazine Monthly June 2024 Issue. She could be obtained from a serial code that was found in her trading card found in the goodies box. As of June 14, 2024, she is ''<u>only</u>'' exclusive to the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version.

