==Trivia==
*It, [[Manga Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Cat]], and [[Manga Boogie Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Boogie Cat]] are based off main characters from The Battle Cats Manga made by Manya Immortal Nosuke (萬屋不死身之介先生) which is published under CoroCoro Comic.
*It, Manga Cat, Manga Boogie Cat, and [[Nora (Special Cat)|Nora]] are currently the only units to originate from a manga.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.8 Update|Patch 1.0.8]], its name was updated from '''Manga Daragogogo Cat''' to '''Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat'''.
*The word ''darabotch'' originates from the yōkai ''daidarabotchi'' which means giant when translated.

